Strategy Decision:
  Deploy dual-layer governance:
  1. Semantic Model YAML uploaded to @SEMANTIC_MODELS_STAGE for Cortex Analyst REST API.
  2. Semantic View DDL in Snowflake catalog for native SQL queries.
  This ensures 100% compatibility across Cortex Analyst, CoCo CLI, and Streamlit.

